{"availability":"available","full":"brocksexton/northline-rp-community-portal","name":"northline-rp-community-portal","description":"Community website for the Northline RP s&box roleplay server: Steam sign-in, live server status, a Twitter-style city feed, forum with Discord sync, leaderboards and staff tools. Next.js 15 + React 19, with a one-command demo.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-30T02:33:37Z","updated":"2026-09-30T03:46:28Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://brocksexton.github.io/northline-rp-community-portal/","topics":["community-portal","discord-bot","game-server","nextjs","react","roleplay","sbox","steam-login","typescript"],"demo":"https://brocksexton.github.io/northline-rp-community-portal/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:54.551Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:54.551Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:54.551Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:54.551Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The community website for Northline RP, an s&box roleplay server running Northbound RP (ApeTavern's aperp gamemode).","The portal sits next to the game server and reads its JSON save files and logs. Players sign in with Steam and get a dashboard, a public profile, a Twitter-style city feed, a forum that syncs with Discord, leaderboards, guides, and a live server status page. Staff get a command center for the console, moderation, applications, maintenance mode, Discord tools, and audits."],"features":["Steam sign-in (OpenID). A player's SteamID links them to their in-game save. The game stays the source of truth.","Homepage. Staff-editable hero messages, live city stats, a \"chaos board\" of how people died, the newest Tweeter posts, and staff notices.","Server status. Online state, who's in the city, joins and leaves over 24 hours, host metrics, and staff notices. It queries the game server directly (Source/A2S over UDP) and falls back to a heartbeat file or the…","Tweeter. A Twitter-style city feed built from the game's in-game tweeter.json. It has threads, profiles, follows, likes, bookmarks, and website-only DMs, plus three layout eras (modern, retro, classic) and several color…","Profiles and the player directory. A profile is created the first time a player signs in on the website, with a cover, theme, bio, and \"showcase\" toggles for economy, inventory, stats, properties, and activity. Profiles…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brocksexton/northline-rp-community-portal/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"41058c1b220c7cf4079ec043ec124eea6b87947491994251bca95e538420ece5","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:54.649Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:54.649Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The community website for Northline RP, an s&box roleplay server running Northbound RP (ApeTavern's aperp gamemode).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brocksexton/northline-rp-community-portal/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Players sign in with Steam and get a dashboard, a public profile, a Twitter-style city feed, a forum that syncs with Discord, leaderboards, guides, and a live server status page.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brocksexton/northline-rp-community-portal/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Steam sign-in (OpenID).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brocksexton/northline-rp-community-portal/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Nothing else is required: no game server, Steam API key, or Discord bot.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brocksexton/northline-rp-community-portal/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"41058c1b220c7cf4079ec043ec124eea6b87947491994251bca95e538420ece5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/brocksexton/northline-rp-community-portal/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt